dated_at":"2024-11-26T15:03:22Z","body":"I've been able to reproduce, I'll investigate later today when I get a chance.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2501054525/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2501226271","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99661#issuecomment-2501226271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99661","id":2501226271,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VFa8f","user":{"login":"tdaven","id":89343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MzQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89343?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven","html_url":"https://github.com/tdaven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T15:52:18Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T15:52:18Z","body":"This is triggered by the MeshEditorPreviewPlugin's generate function which is working to update the mesh preview.  It calls the get_rid (and later get_aabb) on the primitive mesh.  PrimitiveMesh is interesting in these methods because they are not just getters, they also update if there is something pending.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2501226271/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2501511419","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99661#issuecomment-2501511419","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99661","id":2501511419,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VGgj7","user":{"login":"tdaven","id":89343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MzQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89343?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven","html_url":"https://github.com/tdaven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T17:17:48Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T17:17:48Z","body":"A quick fix could be to follow what mesh_instance_3d does and call get_rid before connecting to the changed signal.  See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d09d82d433b03bb3773fd2a8cc8d6ccc2f8739ce/scene/3d/mesh_instance_3d.cpp#L112.\n\nSeems to fix the issue.  Longer term though, seems it would be best to fix primitive mesh to notify of changes  correctly so get_rid and get_aabb rather then having special hacks in locations.\n\nThoughts?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2501511419/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2501845276","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99661#issuecomment-2501845276","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99661","id":2501845276,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VHyEc","user":{"login":"tdaven","id":89343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MzQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89343?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven","html_url":"https://github.com/tdaven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tdaven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-26T20:22:28Z","updated_at":"2024-11-26T20:22:28Z","body":"It's also possible just removing those updates from getters can be done now that mesh_instance_2d connects to changed signal.  Seems to work but unsure if there are side affects not seen yet.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2501845276/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":